---
permalink: /404.html
title: Page not found
noindex: true
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
bodyClass: not-found
# GitHub Pages serves this one file for every missing path, under /es/ too, so every link and asset here is
# root-absolute. The English heading, lead and button come from copy.json → notFound; everything else is
# below. `other` is the one line in the other language under each version's lead.
nfCopy:
  en:
    code: "Page not found"
    nextHeading: "Pick up another thread"
    other: "Ese hilo no lleva a ninguna parte: la página que busca cambió de lugar o nunca existió."
  es:
    code: "Página no encontrada"
    heading: "Ese hilo no lleva a ninguna parte"
    body: "La página que busca cambió de lugar o nunca existió. Todo el tapiz sigue aquí, empezando por la página principal."
    cta: "Volver al inicio"
    nextHeading: "Elija otro hilo"
    other: "That thread leads nowhere: the page you were looking for has moved or never existed."
# The four workshop pages (each has an /es/ twin). Card labels come from i18n.json → nav.
nextPages:
  - { key: "program", href: "/program/", icon: "clipboard-list", legacy: "recovery", desc: "The day at a glance, and the time where you are.", descEs: "El día de un vistazo y la hora donde usted está." }
  - { key: "join", href: "/join/", icon: "video", legacy: "unity", desc: "The Zoom link, meeting ID and passcode.", descEs: "El enlace de Zoom, el ID de reunión y el código de acceso." }
  - { key: "flyer", href: "/flyer/", icon: "image", legacy: "service", desc: "Download, print and share the official flyer.", descEs: "Descargue, imprima y comparta el volante oficial." }
  - { key: "faq", href: "/faq/", icon: "circle-help", legacy: "accent", desc: "Cost, interpretation, anonymity and more.", descEs: "Costo, interpretación, anonimato y más." }
---
{#- The 404 page (/404.html): a short dark band with the logo, the heading, one line in the other language
    and the two front pages, then the four workshop pages. Styles: src/assets/css/pages/misc.css.
    One file serves both languages. The page is built in English; its Spanish twin (same markup, Spanish copy,
    links into /es/) waits in <template id="nf-es">, and the inline script after it swaps that in on a missing
    /es/… path: <main lang="es"> and a Spanish document title. The template's content is not part of the
    page, so there is still one h1. The header and footer stay English (so <html lang="en"> stays right).
    Without JavaScript the English version stays, with its Spanish line and button to the Spanish home page. -#}
{%- set nfEn = copy.notFound | merge(nfCopy.en) -%}
{%- macro notFoundMain(L) -%}
{%- set c = nfCopy.es if L == "es" else nfEn -%}
{%- set other = "en" if L == "es" else "es" -%}
{%- set prefix = "/es" if L == "es" else "" -%}
<section class="nf-hero thread-bg on-dark" aria-labelledby="nf-title-{{ L }}">
  <div class="container-page nf-hero-inner">
    {% inlineSvg "src/assets/img/logo.svg", "nf-logo" %}
    <p class="eyebrow nf-code">404 · {{ c.code }}</p>
    <h1 class="h-display nf-title" id="nf-title-{{ L }}">{{ c.heading | tokens }}</h1>
    <p class="lead nf-lead">{{ c.body | tokens }}</p>
    <p class="nf-other" lang="{{ other }}">{{ c.other }}</p>
    <div class="btn-row nf-actions">
      <a href="{{ prefix }}/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">{% icon "house", "icon" %}<span>{{ c.cta | tokens }}</span></a>
      <a href="{{ '/' if L == 'es' else '/es/' }}" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg" lang="{{ other }}" hreflang="{{ other }}">{% icon "languages", "icon" %}<span>{{ i18n[L].switchLabelHome }}</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-tight" aria-labelledby="nf-next-{{ L }}">
  <div class="container-page nf-next">
    <h2 class="h-card nf-next-title" id="nf-next-{{ L }}">{{ c.nextHeading }}</h2>
    <ul class="nf-links" role="list">
      {% for item in nextPages %}
      <li>
        <a href="{{ prefix }}{{ item.href }}" class="nf-link" data-legacy="{{ item.legacy }}">
          <span class="card-icon">{% icon item.icon, "icon" %}</span>
          <span class="nf-link-text">
            <span class="nf-link-title">{{ i18n[L].nav[item.key] }}</span>
            <span class="nf-link-desc">{{ item.descEs if L == "es" else item.desc }}</span>
          </span>
          {% icon "arrow-right", "icon nf-link-arrow" %}
        </a>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endmacro %}
{{ notFoundMain("en") }}
<template id="nf-es">{{ notFoundMain("es") }}</template>
<script>(function(){if(!/^\/es\//i.test(location.pathname))return;var m=document.getElementById("main"),t=document.getElementById("nf-es");if(!m||!t||!t.content)return;var f=t.content.cloneNode(true);m.lang="es";m.textContent="";m.appendChild(f);document.title={{ (nfCopy.es.code + " · " + site.name) | json | safe }}})()</script>
